<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of a committee shall hold office on such conditions and for such term as may be specified in his letter of appointment and is eligible for reappointment."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
