<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee may invite any person to attend any of its meetings for the purpose of advising it on any matter under discussion but that person shall not be entitled to vote at the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
