<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the Commission shall bear a device as approved by the Commission and the seal may from time to time be broken, changed, altered and made anew as the Commission thinks fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Until a seal is provided by the Commission, a stamp bearing the words “Competition Commission” may be used and shall be deemed to be its common seal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal shall be kept in the custody of the Chairman or any other person authorized by the Commission, and shall be authenticated by either the Chairman or by such other person authorized by the Chairman in writing."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
