<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any deed, document and other instrument which, if executed by a person not being a body corporate, is not required to be under seal may in like manner be executed by a member of the Commission or any other person authorized by the Commission on behalf of the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
