<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, from time to time, appoint and employ such number of employees as it thinks necessary and upon such terms as it considers appropriate for carrying out the purposes of the competition laws."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
