<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, with the approval of the Minister, determine the conditions of service of its employees. Loans, scholarships and advances"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
