<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may grant loans, scholarships and advances to its employees for such purposes and on such terms as the Commission may determine. Payment of retirement benefits, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
