<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may make arrangements for the payment to its employees and their dependants of such retirement benefits, pensions, gratuities and other allowances as the Commission may determine. Commission may adopt regulations, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
