<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://schema.org/text> "No action, suit, prosecution or proceedings shall be instituted in any court against the Commission, a Commission officer or any other person acting on behalf of the Commission or a Commission officer in respect of any act ordered to be done or done by him in such capacity provided that he at the time had carried out his functions in good faith."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
