<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_44__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "in any other civil proceedings in which the Commission is required or permitted by the court to be represented, or to be heard, or is otherwise entitled to be represented or to be heard, any person authorized by the Commission for that purpose may, on behalf of the Commission, or the employee or Commission officer, institute such proceedings or appear in such proceedings and may make all appearances and applications and do all acts in respect of the proceedings on behalf of the Commission. Power to employ"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "45" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
