<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Commission is given power to publish, or is required to publish, a direction, guidance, withdrawal, clearance, nomination or other decision or document under the competition laws, such publication may be by electronic means in such manner as is likely to make it reasonably accessible to any person wishing to view it, and publication of a document by that method shall be effective for all purposes under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_VI__cl_47__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
