<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall, before 1 January of the following year, notify the Commission of the amount authorized for expenditure generally or of the amount authorized for each description of expenditure based on the estimate prepared under subsection (2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
