<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission may, at any time, submit to the Minister a supplementary estimate of its expenditure for any one year and the Minister may allow the whole or any part of the additional expenditure included in the supplementary estimate. Bank accounts"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
