<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V__cl_36> <https://schema.org/text> "The financial year of the Commission shall begin on 1 January and end on 31 December of each year. Annual report"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
