<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~part_V__cl_37> <https://schema.org/text> "The Statutory Bodies (Accounts and Annual Reports) Act 1980 [Act 240] shall apply to the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
