<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "At least fourteen days’ notice in writing shall be given to the members."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
