<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman and at least half of the other members of the Commission shall form a quorum at any meeting of the Commission. Casting vote"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/6/eng@> .
